<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Document</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <label
      class="group has-[:checked]:border-brand-700 has-[:checked]:ring-brand-700 relative flex min-h-[112px] cursor-pointer items-center gap-4 rounded-[15px] border border-[#d8d8d8] px-5 py-4 transition has-[:checked]:ring-1"
    >
      <input class="peer sr-only" type="radio" name="shippingMethod" value="${method.value}" />
      <span
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="peer-checked:border-brand-700 peer-checked:bg-brand-700 grid size-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-md border-2 border-[#93a4b5] text-sm text-transparent transition peer-checked:text-white"
        >✓</span
      >
      <span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 gap-2"
        ><strong class="text-base"></strong
        ><span class="text-sm leading-6 text-[#8b9aab]"
          >از طریق پیک (درون شهری) - اکسپرس - تحویل حدود ۶ تا ۱۲ ساعت</span
        ></span
      >
      <strong class="shrink-0 self-end text-sm font-medium md:self-center"></strong>
    </label>
  </body>
</html>
